@startuml phase8_simple
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam DefaultFontSize 10

' Extreme spacing to prevent overlap
skinparam participant {
    Padding 40
    FontSize 8
}
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantPadding 80
    BoxPadding 40
}
skinparam minClassWidth 220
skinparam TitleFontSize 10

title Phase 8 Pipeline Improvement (Simplified)

' Use simple names without complex descriptions
actor CAM
database Queue
control TCP
control JPEG
boundary GUI

CAM -> Queue: push frame
Queue -> TCP: pull frame
TCP -> JPEG: send data
JPEG -> GUI: update display

note over CAM, GUI
Phase 8 achieves 6.74fps with 3-thread pipeline
- Camera: 30fps generation
- TCP: Non-blocking processing
- JPEG: Parallel decoding
- GUI: Continuous response
end note

@enduml